      "updated": 1757865959130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronous vs Asynchronous",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Synchronous vs Asynchronous",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2XHS8VOxn4urJb-b31GaZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3965.652419672112,
      "y": 5311.757707944322,
      "width": 660,
      "height": 550,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 696624845,
      "version": 1923,
      "versionNonce": 549644438,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757867056862,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Synchronous\n- Executing instructions 1 by 1\n- Each instruction waits before the previous one \ncompletes\n\nAsynchronous\n- Execute instructions where if there is a long runnign task\nin the instructions it starts and runs in the background\nand other tasks will run while it finalizes\n\n\nconst add = (a,b) => {\n    return a + b;\n}\n\n\nconst val = add(2,3)\n\n\nconsole.log(\"A\")\ngetSolarUnits()\nconsole.log(\"C\")",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Synchronous\n- Executing instructions 1 by 1\n- Each instruction waits before the previous one \ncompletes\n\nAsynchronous\n- Execute instructions where if there is a long runnign task\nin the instructions it starts and runs in the background\nand other tasks will run while it finalizes\n\n\nconst add = (a,b) => {\n    return a + b;\n}\n\n\nconst val = add(2,3)\n\n\nconsole.log(\"A\")\ngetSolarUnits()\nconsole.log(\"C\")",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cQ7Y8fMqiCmgp9KSmAoBL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3967.7794554239554,
      "y": 5920.097755023851,
      "width": 816.19970703125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
